// 2_core_lobby_hud-02
// Bug: NoSabotageDuration is set to true for a Boobytrap or Shutdown sabotage and never reset, so every later timed sabotage on the same HUD shows "?" and its icon never times out.
// Fix: reset NoSabotageDuration to false at the start of InitializeSabotageIcons; the Boobytrap/Shutdown branch still sets it to true for those sabotages.

before InitializeSabotageIcons {
    NoSabotageDuration = false;
}
